{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55039","headline":"兵要望江南 占梦第二十五（京本列第十三○九首） 六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占梦第二十五（京本列第十三○九首） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军梦，见水及（京本作「梦见汲」）波涛。\n或（京本作「忽」）与敌人相角（京本作「争」）竞，须来挑（京本作「排」）战莫轻交，坚守我门桥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55039.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55039","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}